{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：22:15 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>今日《ViuTV 2027節目巡禮》上，Ivy（蘇雅琳＠COLLAR）坦言，恨拍偶像劇，主演新劇港版《金秘書為何那樣》於明年1月播。續說，去年自己無拍劇，今年拍完劇，好快就播，非常期待。期待拍劇已久的Candy（王家晴＠COLLAR）透露，主演新劇《心跳日記》就快煞科，形容自己圓夢，完成了拍偶像劇的目標，是次演出，膽戰心驚，挑戰很多感情戲份。</p>\n<h2>Candy集氣903籃球賽落場一分鐘</h2>\n<p>Ivy、Anson Lo（盧瀚霆）為《金秘書為何那樣》錄合唱歌，Candy透露同歐鎮灝（George）、吳啟洋（Phoebus）錄《心跳日記》主題曲，同時參與新綜藝《公司又逼我打籃球》，重拾籃球訓練時光，望下月有機會為903籃球賽出賽一分鐘。談到兩人又再次同日出歌，Candy笑言今次打和，一齊推出MV，到時合作宣傳或會一齊開Live，從來不擔心自己人打自己人，與眾同樂。</p>\n<img alt=\"今日《ViuTV 2027節目巡禮》上，Candy明言恨拍偶像劇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/532e7ac98e7e780c2f1120b6a8ee6d02/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_19_04_42_1__0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Ivy、Anson Lo將為《金秘書為何那樣》錄合唱歌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/00a3b44c03c5644e47e5aa9570324593/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_19_04_42_2__0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Candy、Ivy炫耀嫰腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/985b732afe02d007967607ff789e8efa/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_19_04_43_1__0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Candy集氣903籃球賽落場一分鐘。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/986750ae99fd5f7d819c7d9876648103/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_19_04_43_2__0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Candy形容，拍偶像劇《心跳日記》是圓夢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/dfb4e56a7481cc05f5112ea61137709c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_19_04_43_3__0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Ivy、Anson Lo等人一同宣傳《金秘書為何那樣》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a7e6d0ae5df457eaba30167b4b8e29d3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_19_06_24_1.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"今日《ViuTV 2027節目巡禮》人才濟濟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a55de341d80f553beacdf69600250d34/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_19_04_48_2__0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Candy同歐鎮灝、吳啟洋錄《心跳日記》主題曲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/7db0575000d13008aa65a5a5ef9040db/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_19_05_53_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Candy參與新綜藝《公司又逼我打籃球》，重拾籃球訓練時光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/2fcc9dbe4830cd020f681719fd2c9c68/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_19_06_11_0.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T14:41:56.952916+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":404,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:15:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T16:18:01.126766+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:38:31.936409+00:00","content_hash":"dadac60c331179829619ab37ca30e4997ae34d6fb5c5f5f15a099e0071b11c89","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}